            "review_title": "Review at Yo Yummy Oi Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nRecommended.\nJun 2022\nAn Asian food market where you can choose different nations specialties, from Chinese, Korean, Singapore, HK, Indian and so on. A lot of good food to pick, and plenty of seating available. \nOrder the food at counter and then wait at table for it to be delivered, and beers too.......simple.\nWe went for three different dishes........HK roasted duck, Korean BBQ and some Singapore noodles..............all dishes were served quickly and tasted fantastic. \nOnly negative, the waiter in his eagerness to clear the table, took our beers...........no apology but anyway he is young.........\nGood place for a variety of good dishes and affordable, in very relaxed surroundings.\nRecommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 29, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
